{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "46596febf5dd84173052dd317174638f0e6a904c5255e7482efab98345d7297c", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影に向け、茜が\n衣装の試着をしているが、随分と時間がかかっている）", "zh": "（为了拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》，茜正在试穿服装，不过已经花了相当长时间）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "225e10ebffdf728e6679e4dfdbd665fa2ab108393e757750922329c7833c821a", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、大変！\n大変だよ！！　どうしよう、まずいよこれは！", "zh": "{$P$}，大事不好！\n大事不好啊！！怎么办，这下糟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5ec09ec4bf1053a737deafef8815203cc4ddc80cf3aeffd78069b1a2df8e235", "ja": "茜！？　どうした、そんなに慌てて！", "zh": "茜！？怎么了，慌慌张张的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "09704040cdd48437d9f15a295e1fb5d93d3586f9c8adc00b12d648a19027bd17", "ja": "見てよ{$P$}ちゃん！\nワンピースを着た茜ちゃん……カワイすぎる！", "zh": "你看{$P$}！\n穿着连衣裙的小茜……可爱过头了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "c8b130252b03cb51d11f43c49f857fdf3a4fb025b4aa5c607dce743703a7690e", "ja": "鏡に映った自分の姿を見て、ビックリ\nしちゃったんだよ！　このカワイさは、まさに罪……！", "zh": "看着镜子里映出的自己，吓了一跳呢！　这份可爱，简直就是罪过……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1005_p", "source_sha256": "688cc368fcc4633fa24fcf881503ca3e1c2828cc1d9b031049dde142f0b7a0b7", "ja": "あ、はい。", "zh": "啊，好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "5ecce96e7e9dce80a981414aa03b9ee119cdb9f95112e601d759bf3ec8b39d30", "ja": "反応薄いよ、{$P$}ちゃん！　これが\nどれだけ大変なことかちゃんと分かってるのかニャ？", "zh": "反应太冷淡了，{$P$}！这可是多么不得了的事情，你到底明不明白喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "b44a479ccbc83b8067cd3c3c10f991f255888e19b35a5e0e367b88b5917b72f9", "ja": "ただでさえ超美少女の茜ちゃんが、\n美少女の象徴のような白ワンピを着ちゃってるんだよ？", "zh": "本来就是超级美少女的小茜，还穿上了仿佛美少女象征的白色连衣裙，这不是要命吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "fb96f535e8b9fca4c1f4955636aa87002f24dcc76b55f99d129dba401fcd6bc8", "ja": "こんな超美少女中の超超美少女の写真が出回ったら……\nファンのみんなが！　いや、世界が危ないっ！！", "zh": "像这样超级美少女中的超级超级美少女的照片一旦传出去……粉丝们！不，整个世界都会有危险！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "a833d9f7029f587ed55b33b41e9032a40f5c6d75747f6506ee600139078a364b", "ja": "さすがに今の茜ちゃんのカワイさは、世界にとって刺激\nが強すぎるよ！　茜ちゃんショックが起きちゃう！", "zh": "现在的小茜可爱程度，对全世界来说果然刺激太强了！\n要引发小茜冲击了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0f28462ff18dbb9421ceb2b238e3dbc5e9fa12d5f26a6a9192876764a651e680", "ja": "茜、ちょっと待って欲しい。世界は危なかった\nとしても、茜のファンは……それぐらいで倒れるかな？", "zh": "茜，先等一下。就算世界真的陷入了危机，茜的粉丝……也不至于因为这种程度就倒下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "5c89569952726cf3a91177e660b738e85281464eafefa13e409d3a81c55e7ac5", "ja": "ニャッ！？　{$P$}ちゃん……それは\nつまり、みんなが茜ちゃんの衝撃に耐えられると……？", "zh": "喵！？{$P$}……你的意思是，大家都能承受住小茜的冲击吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1012_p", "source_sha256": "704d959d72fef034337c4aae8aed09b7b6715252373c46265816f816d4d3727f", "ja": "確かに、ワンピースはよく似合ってるよ。\nファンの人たちにも、いい刺激を与えられると思う。", "zh": "确实，连衣裙很适合你。\n我觉得也能给粉丝们带来不小的惊喜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "532d6ea34458a2163254af8f7b02fbb4f6ce095bf1f11792a354ab6d7d95f3ed", "ja": "でも。茜のファンは、今までもずっと、\n茜のカワイさを見せつけられてきたはずだろ？", "zh": "不过，茜的粉丝们到现在为止，应该一直都被茜的可爱冲击着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "a9ca7be6f3287509a5c1244c95d3ae19e7a04497e2189e42b695ffe20eb10685", "ja": "ハッ……！　確かに……今までもみんなは、\nたくさんの試練を乗り越えてきてる！", "zh": "哈……！确实……大家一直以来，都跨越了许多试炼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "723a7ebcc5687162c52e617f21154ed361e3f5b93968fe9e299259cd0dec1d6f", "ja": "茜ちゃんから放たれている、高濃度の美少女オーラを\n直接浴びても、膝を折る人なんていなかった……！", "zh": "即使直接沐浴在从小茜身上散发出的高浓度美少女气场中，也没有人屈膝倒下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "d16a7edd01eb484a1747b5bdefef620ad8e4c3f9b98aee97c16858d525a58c04", "ja": "つまり……茜ちゃんファンたちは、茜ちゃんの\n知らない間に、そんなレベルにまで進化してたんだね！", "zh": "也就是说……小茜的粉丝们，已经在小茜不知情的情况下，进化到那种程度了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9339fb77ca84686d69d1f58da0c5118563df5c18ede449d18a32e7f96c2720c4", "ja": "ああ！　そんな訓練された人たちを相手に、\n手加減したカワイさでいいのか？　茜！", "zh": "啊！面对这样训练有素的人，只展现有所收敛的可爱，真的没问题吗？茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "39fe8443d7b21545b032ba0fcab3245c77e7e2bdcbddf42ebe474356e4321269", "ja": "フッ……わかったよ、{$P$}ちゃん。\n茜ちゃんはもう、可愛すぎる罪を犯すことを恐れない！", "zh": "哼……知道了，{$P$}。\n小茜已经不再害怕犯下可爱过头之罪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "e4b20968fc0b3647601808f9937eea3e42471cdad3bac8ef71a7704885163e84", "ja": "撮影までに、ポーズもスマイルもバッチリ特訓して、\n清楚系超美少女アイドルになってみせるからねっ！", "zh": "在拍摄前，我会把姿势和笑容都特训得完美无缺，变身成清纯系超美少女偶像给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0223_1020_p", "source_sha256": "15afe72ff7ec23a23d82a15399d8d232829e35a2bb459ec32bd58b2c8c933cb6", "ja": "（そう言って茜は、早速ポージングの練習を始めた。\nやる気が出たみたいだし、本番も期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（说完这些，茜便立刻开始练习摆姿势。看来她干劲十足，正式拍摄时也值得期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
